                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="fw-bold">H型钢 / 工字钢</td>
                                        <td>翼缘腹板内直角</td>
                                        <td>内阴角气流涡流反弹</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">1.15</span></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr class="table-warning">
                                        <td class="fw-bold text-danger">圆管 / 圆形 (CHS)</td>
